# ── Make API call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
@When "^retrieves the full governed currency code list$"
    Given build request as user 'maker@example.com'
    When get from path '/refdata/currencies'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@Then "^the governed currency code list should be retrieved successfully$"
    Then response status code is '200'
    And response matches current scenario
    And response body contains a non-empty value at key 'data'

@Then "^the governed currency code list is returned with a total count of '([^']*)'$"
    Then response status code is '200'
    And response matches current scenario
    And response body contains an element 'data' of size $1
